            }
          ],
          "series_items": [],
          "patch_summary": "This patch fixes a use-after-free (UAF) bug in the RedRat3 USB interface driver. When the probe fails after registering the RC device, the error path leaves the device registered and points to freed memory. The patch ensures that the RC device is properly cleaned up when the probe fails by adding code to unregister the device before freeing the main rr3 structure.",
